 run "installer (tools/fm1_install.py): FM-1 and SMK-37, install and the update-mode resume check the model" python3 tests/install_test.py
 
+# the fm-1-experiments host-compat set (FELUCCA_UAC_MIDI_LAST / FELUCCA_UAC_IAD / FELUCCA_USB_SERIAL),
+# the plain build scripts/build-dinghy.sh makes: order AC, AS, MIDI, the AC collection naming the
